  "@type": "sc:Dataset",
  "name": "Copernicus Urban Atlas 2018 — Barcelona Functional Urban Area",
  "description": "Pan-European harmonised land-use/land-cover product at 10m resolution for Functional Urban Areas (FUAs). The sealed-surface fraction layer (0–100%) quantifies impervious surface cover per 10m pixel from very-high-resolution satellite imagery. Barcelona FUA extent. Used as the sealed-surface barrier sub-score input (SQ2) in the Mycorrhizal Barcelona project. 2018 vintage; 2021 update available but not yet ingested.",
  "url": "https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas/urban-atlas-2018",
  "version": "2018 (V01, published 2024-11-15)",
